@startuml
title SLE-3 Level 4 - Code Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Binary Search Engine" {

    rectangle "binary_search(arr, target)" as Search

    rectangle "calculate_mid(low, high)" as Mid

    rectangle "compare_target(arr[mid], target)" as Compare

    rectangle "update_range(low, high)" as Update

    rectangle "return_result(index)" as Result
}

Search --> Mid : low, high
Mid --> Compare : mid

Compare --> Result : Target found
Compare --> Update : Target not found

Update --> Mid : New low / high

@enduml